  "form_descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Les formes ont des stats différentes. Si le talent d’Exagide est Déclic Tactique, il prend la Forme Assaut avant d’utiliser une capacité offensive, et reprend la Forme Parade avant d’utiliser Bouclier Royal ou en quittant le terrain.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Forms have different stats.  If Aegislash’s ability is Stance Change, it changes to Blade Forme before using a damaging move, and reverts to Shield Forme before using King’s Shield or upon leaving the field.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "れきだいの　おうが　つれていた。\nれいりょくで　ひとや　ポケモンの\nこころを　あやつり　したがわせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "역대 왕들이 데리고 있었다.\n영험한 힘으로 사람이나 포켓몬의\n마음을 조종하여 복종하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils ont fait le bonheur de générations de rois.\nLeurs pouvoirs psychiques leur permettent de\ncontrôler hommes et Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Generationen von Königen hatten dieses Pokémon\nan ihrer Seite. Mit seiner mysteriösen Kraft kann es\nMenschen und Pokémon gleichermaßen kontrollieren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Han permanecido junto a estirpes de reyes durante\ngeneraciones. Mediante su poder espectral pueden\ncontrolar a humanos y a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha accompagnato generazioni di re. È in grado di\ncontrollare e manipolare esseri umani e Pokémon col\nsuo potere spettrale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Generations of kings were attended by these\nPokémon, which used their spectral power to\nmanipulate and control people and Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "歴代の　王が　連れていた。\n霊力で　人や　ポケモンの\n心を　操り　従わせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Han permanecido junto a estirpes de reyes durante\ngeneraciones. Mediante su poder espectral pueden\ncontrolar a humanos y a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おうの　そしつを　もつ　にんげんを\nみぬくらしい。みとめられた　ひとは\nやがて　おうになると　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "왕의 기질을 가진 인간을\n간파하는 듯하다. 인정받은 자는\n이윽고 왕이 된다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut déceler les qualités régaliennes dans les âmes\nhumaines. On raconte que celui ou celle qui obtient\nsa faveur deviendra à coup sûr roi ou reine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Angeblich erkennt es jene Menschen, die Potenzial\nzum Herrscher haben. Es heißt, von ihm anerkannte\nPersonen seien bald darauf Könige geworden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al parecer, puede intuir si un humano tiene madera\nde rey. Según se dice, las personas que obtuvieron\nsu reconocimiento acabaron siendo reyes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che sia in grado di riconoscere chi possiede le\nqualità per diventare re e che le persone da lui\nindicate siano effettivamente destinate al trono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities\nof leadership. According to legend, whoever it\nrecognizes is destined to become king.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "王の　素質を　持つ　人間を\n見抜くらしい。認められた　人は\nやがて　王になると　言われている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
