    {
      "flavor_text": "はがねの　からだと　れいりょくの\nバリアで　あらゆる　こうげきを\nよわめる　ぼうぎょの　たいせい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강철로 된 몸과 영험한 힘을 가진\n배리어로 모든 공격을\n약하게 만드는 방어적인 태세.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "處於防禦狀態時，\n會用鋼之身體和靈力的屏障\n來減弱一切的攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grâce à son corps en acier et à sa barrière\npsychique, il peut se défendre en affaiblissant\ntoutes sortes d’attaques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinem stählernen Körper und der Barriere,\ndie es durch eine mysteriöse Kraft erzeugt,\nvermag es jegliche Angriffe abzuschwächen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias a su cuerpo de acero y a una barrera de\npoder espectral, crea una defensa que le permite\nmitigar prácticamente cualquier ataque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con il suo corpo metallico e la sua barriera\npsichica può opporre una difesa in grado di\nindebolire qualsiasi tipo di attacco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In this defensive stance, Aegislash uses its steel\nbody and a force field of spectral power to\nreduce the damage of any attack.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鋼の　体と　霊力の\nバリアで　あらゆる　攻撃を\n弱める　防御の　体勢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "处于防御状态时，\n会用钢之身体和灵力的屏障\n来减弱一切的攻击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
